e Board demands your full focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/48022d5d53be4a9bb7e53e06cc90676c.poster.avif?t=1788184265\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/48022d5d53be4a9bb7e53e06cc90676c.webm?t=1788184265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/48022d5d53be4a9bb7e53e06cc90676c.mp4?t=1788184265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/763e9b828141fc9a731dafe5e1f035e4.avif?t=1788184265\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras_big/763e9b828141fc9a731dafe5e1f035e4.webp?t=1788184265 width=1560 height=103 /></span>Sharpen your multitasking. Juggle several tasks at once, chase the next stimulus, chain actions together. Make the chaos work and beat your high score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c2e82f9a237452139e07017867b69c4c.poster.avif?t=1788184265\" width=1170 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c2e82f9a237452139e07017867b69c4c.webm?t=1788184265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978110/extras/c2e82f9a237452139e07017867b69c4c.mp4?t=1788184265\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"